# hover-row-k (plan section 6, M7): the pointer on k's row, on its name (200, 468): the row's band
# (k's 18 % tint), its name in --foreground, the box's 2 px stroke, k's term lit in the equation
# and k's dimension line on the plane. Row k is (49, 446.5, 394 x 44) at 1440 x 900.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 200 468
wait 500
shot hover-row-k
